# STIG RHEL-09-411065: GNOME thumbnailers-disabled
# STIG ID: V-258052 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-411065-dconf-thumbnailers-disabled-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-411065: All RHEL 9 local interactive user home directories defined in the /etc/passwd fi`
    description `All RHEL 9 local interactive user home directories defined in the /etc/passwd file must exist.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,gnome,dconf`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-411065,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-411065.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT dconf_check
        schema `org.gnome.desktop.thumbnailers`
        key `disable-all`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE setting_correct
        applicable boolean = true
        value string = `true`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN dconf_setting
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF setting_correct
            OBJECT_REF dconf_check
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
